    "detailed_description": "Hero's black dungeon is a 2D action roguelike. Take control of a young adventurer who travels to the Mediterranean lands in search of adventure and glory. On your way you will meet quite a few enemies and interesting characters. Arm yourself with magical blades and chop down enemies on your way! Complete tasks, collect resources and go deeper and deeper through the floors!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game you have to clear locations from enemies, complete your goals and go deeper into the dungeon.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to become a real hero and explore dark dungeons while fighting the forces of evil? Then go on a journey with a young adventurer and test yourself!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n- Pixel graphics<br />\r\n- Various enemies<br />\r\n- Good soundtrack",
